<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{ product.title }}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    {{ 'swiper-bundle.min.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0807/0086/6801/files/spage-YH105674-19-HR_2.css?v=1791966264">

    {% comment %} 落地页内容 {% endcomment %}
    <div
      id="root"
      data-page-id="20"
      style="
        --wrapper-mw:1432px;
        --primary-color:#1BBA85;
        --secondary-color: #EFF7FF;
        --third-color: #FF0000;
        --btn-color:#fff;
        --btn-bg-color:#1BBA85;
      "
    >

      {% comment %} 公告栏 {% endcomment %}
      <div class="announcement-bar-w">
        Vremenski ograničen program potpore za rehabilitaciju: <strong>Uštedite do <span class="js-bind-discount-percent">60%</span> danas · 30 dana probnog razdoblja bez rizika</strong>
      </div>

      {% comment %} 头部 {% endcomment %}
      <section class="sph" id="sp-shopping-header" data-sp-header aria-label="Page header">
        {%- liquid
          assign sph_logo = logo | default: '' | strip
          if sph_logo == blank and settings.logo != blank
            assign sph_logo = settings.logo | image_url: width: 600
          endif
          if sph_logo == blank
            assign sph_logo = 'https://zapieers.com/cdn/shop/files/zapieers.png?v=1775205855&width=240'
          endif
        -%}
        <div class="sph__bar">
          <div class="sph__inner ">
            <div class="sph__left">
              <a
                class="sph__logo sph__scroll"
                href="{{ routes.root_url }}"
                aria-label="{{ shop.name | escape }}"
              >
                <img
                  src="{{ sph_logo }}"
                  alt="{{ shop.name | escape }}"
                  width="178"
                  height="48"
                  loading="eager"
                  decoding="async"
                >
              </a>
              
            </div>

            <div class="sph__right">
              <nav class="sph__nav" aria-label="Section navigation">
                <a class="sph__nav-link sph__scroll" href="#size" data-sph-target="size">
                  <img
                    src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0991/9614/1880/files/size.png?v=1777014292"
                    alt=""
                    width="18"
                    height="18"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  >
                  <span>Tablica veličina</span>
                </a>
               
                <a class="sph__nav-link sph__scroll" href="#reviews" data-sph-target="reviews">
                  <img
                    src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0991/9614/1880/files/comment.png?v=1777014292"
                    alt=""
                    width="18"
                    height="18"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  >
                  <span>Recenzije</span>
                </a>
               
                <a class="sph__nav-link sph__scroll" href="#faq" data-sph-target="faq">
                  <img
                    src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0991/9614/1880/files/faq.png?v=1777014292"
                    alt=""
                    width="18"
                    height="18"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  >
                  <span>Česta pitanja</span>
                </a>
              </nav>

              <button class="sph__cart js-cart" type="button" aria-label="Open shopping cart">
                <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/cart2.png?v=1790577401" alt="">
                <span class="text">Košarica</span>
                <span class="sph__cart-count js-cardNum{% if cart.item_count < 1 %} sp-gray{% endif %}">
                  {{- cart.item_count -}}
                </span>
              </button>

              <a class="sph__cta sph__scroll" href="#shopping" data-sph-target="shopping">
                <span>Kupite sada</span>
              </a>

              <button
                type="button"
                class="sph__menu-toggle js-header-menu-btn"
                aria-label="Open navigation menu"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="sph-drawer"
              >
                <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sph__drawer-backdrop js-header-menu-btn" data-header-menu aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <aside class="sph__drawer" id="sph-drawer" data-header-menu aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="sph__drawer-head">
            <strong>Izbornik</strong>
            <button type="button" class="sph__drawer-close js-header-menu-btn" aria-label="Close navigation menu">
              ×
            </button>
          </div>
          <nav class="sph__drawer-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation">
            <a class="sph__drawer-link sph__scroll js-header-menu-btn" href="#size" data-sph-target="size">
              <img
                src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0991/9614/1880/files/size.png?v=1777014292"
                alt=""
                width="20"
                height="20"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              >
              <span>Tablica veličina</span>
            </a>
            <a class="sph__drawer-link sph__scroll js-header-menu-btn" href="#reviews" data-sph-target="reviews">
              <img
                src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0991/9614/1880/files/comment.png?v=1777014292"
                alt=""
                width="20"
                height="20"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              >
              <span>Recenzije</span>
            </a>
            <a class="sph__drawer-link sph__scroll js-header-menu-btn" href="#faq" data-sph-target="faq">
              <img
                src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0991/9614/1880/files/faq.png?v=1777014292"
                alt=""
                width="20"
                height="20"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              >
              <span>Česta pitanja</span>
            </a>
            <button class="sph__drawer-link js-cart js-header-menu-btn" type="button">
              <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/add-cart.png?v=1788945807" alt="">
              <span
                >Košarica (<span class="js-cardNum">{{ cart.item_count }}</span>)</span
              >
            </button>
          </nav>
        </aside>
      </section>

      {% comment %} 产品功介绍和服务 {% endcomment %}
      <section class="sp-product-intro" id="product-intro">
        <div class="sp-product-intro__inner">
          <div class="sp-product-intro__main">
            <div class="sp-product-intro__copy reveal-on-scroll">
              <div class="sp-product-intro__rating stext20">
                <img
                  class="sp-product-intro__trustpilot"
                  src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/df7602c7facea48f153b8c79c2f851aa.svg?v=1791443228"
                  alt="Trustpilot"
                  width="88"
                  height="22"
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                >
                <span>4.7 / 5</span>
              </div>
              <p class="sp-product-intro__tag">NOVOST U EUROPI</p>
              <h2 class="sp-product-intro__title stitle2">Revolucionarna amortizacija koja mijenja način na koji ljudi hodaju*</h2>
              <p class="sp-product-intro__desc stext2">
                Inovativna tehnologija amortizacije, osmišljena za ispravljanje hoda i smanjenje pritiska na stopala, mijenja način hodanja tisuća ljudi diljem Europe. Ove ortopedske cipele kombiniraju potporu svodu stopala, stabilizaciju od pete do prstiju i višeslojnu amortizaciju kako bi ublažile bol i svaki korak učinile mekšim, stabilnijim i udobnijim.
              </p>

              <ul class="sp-product-intro__features">
                <li class="sp-product-intro__feature">
                  <span class="sp-product-intro__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1C981C"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <p class="stext2">
                    <strong>Potpora svodu stopala </strong>
                    pomaže u liječenju plantarnog fascitisa i ublažava kroničnu bol u peti.*
                  </p>
                </li>
                <li class="sp-product-intro__feature">
                  <span class="sp-product-intro__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1C981C"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <p class="stext2">
                    <strong>Prostrani prednji dio</strong>
                     pomaže kod čukljeva i vraća prste u prirodan položaj.*
                  </p>
                </li>
                <li class="sp-product-intro__feature">
                  <span class="sp-product-intro__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1C981C"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <p class="stext2">
                    <strong>Stabilizirajući potplat </strong>
                    poboljšava ravnotežu pri hodanju te sprječava padove i ozljede.*
                  </p>
                </li>
              </ul>

              <a class="common-button sp-product-intro__cta" href="#shopping">
                OSTVARITE&nbsp;<span class="js-bind-discount-percent" style="color: #fff;">60%</span>&nbsp;POPUSTA SAMO DANAS!
                <img class="btn-arrow" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/right.png?v=1790561295" alt="right">
              </a>

              <div class="sp-product-intro__stock stext2">
                <span class="sp-product-intro__stock-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <img
                    src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0990/0215/5371/files/icons8-_-96.apng?v=1783565616"
                    width="20"
                    height="20"
                    alt=""
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  >
                </span>
                <span>Trenutačne zalihe : </span>
                <span>Preostalo je samo 6 komada!</span>
                <span class="sp-product-intro__stock-bar" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="88.97296142578125" height="15.49456787109375" viewBox="0 0 88.97296142578125 15.49456787109375" fill="none"><rect x="0" y="0.5" width="14.494592145452486" height="14.494592145452486"   fill="#FF0000" ></rect><rect x="18.494590759277344" y="0.5" width="14.494592145452486" height="14.494592145452486" stroke="rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)" stroke-width="1"      fill="#FFFFFF" ></rect><rect x="36.98918151855469" y="0.5" width="14.494592145452486" height="14.494592145452486" stroke="rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)" stroke-width="1"      fill="#FFFFFF" ></rect><rect x="55.48377990722656" y="0.5" width="14.494592145452486" height="14.494592145452486" stroke="rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)" stroke-width="1"      fill="#FFFFFF" ></rect><rect x="73.97836303710938" y="0.5" width="14.494592145452486" height="14.494592145452486" stroke="rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)" stroke-width="1"      fill="#FFFFFF" ></rect></svg>
                </span>
                <span class="sp-product-intro__stock-low">NISKE</span>
              </div>

              <p class="sp-product-intro__secure stext2">
                <span aria-hidden="true">🔒</span>
                Zajamčeno sigurno plaćanje | SSL zaštita
                <span aria-hidden="true">🔒</span>
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="sp-product-intro__media reveal-on-scroll" data-sp-intro-video>
              <video
                class="sp-product-intro__video js-lazy-video"
                playsinline
                webkit-playsinline
                muted
                loop
                preload="none"
                poster="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/poster.webp?v=1790751748"
                width="720"
                height="720"
                data-sp-intro-player
              >
                <source data-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/e70ad49bc0c449228364af63ff96d905.webm" type="video/mp4">
              </video>
       
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sp-product-intro__services ">
            <article class="sp-product-intro__service reveal-on-scroll">
              <img
                class="sp-product-intro__service-icon"
                src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/30day-18.png?v=1791529439"
                alt=""
                width="92"
                height="92"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              >
              <div class="sp-product-intro__service-body">
                <h3 class="sp-product-intro__service-title stexts2">30 dana jamstva povrata novca</h3>
                <p class="sp-product-intro__service-text stext2">
                  Sigurni smo da će vam se svidjeti — isprobajte ih bez rizika 30 dana ili zatražite puni povrat novca.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="sp-product-intro__service reveal-on-scroll">
              <img
                class="sp-product-intro__service-icon"
                src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/shopping.png?v=1790155525"
                alt=""
                width="92"
                height="92"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              >
              <div class="sp-product-intro__service-body">
                <h3 class="sp-product-intro__service-title stexts2">Dostava s praćenjem diljem svijeta</h3>
                <p class="sp-product-intro__service-text stext2">
                  Svaka narudžba ima praćenje uživo i osiguranje prijevoza.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="sp-product-intro__service reveal-on-scroll">
              <img
                class="sp-product-intro__service-icon"
                src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/good17.png?v=1790155524"
                alt=""
                width="92"
                height="92"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              >
              <div class="sp-product-intro__service-body">
                <h3 class="sp-product-intro__service-title stexts2">Potvrđeno od stvarnih korisnika</h3>
                <p class="sp-product-intro__service-text stext2">
                  Razvijeno i testirano na temelju stvarnih povratnih informacija
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>


      {% comment %} 视频列表介绍 {% endcomment %}
      <section class="sp-video-list" id="video-list">
        <div class="sp-video-list__inner">
          <h2 class="sp-video-list__title stitle2 reveal-on-scroll">Po čemu se ovaj par toliko razlikuje od ostalih?</h2>

          <div class="sp-video-list__grid">
            <article class="sp-video-list__card reveal-on-scroll">
              <div class="sp-video-list__media">
                <video
                  class="sp-video-list__video js-lazy-video"
                  playsinline
                  webkit-playsinline
                  muted
                  loop
                  autoplay
                  preload="none"
                  poster="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/2-poster-1.webp?v=1790751747"
                  width="640"
                  height="400"
                >
                  <source data-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/68d1dbf877b74bf7a949db513bb0f6e5.webm" type="video/webm">
                </video>
              </div>
              <div class="sp-video-list__body">
                <h3 class="sp-video-list__card-title stexts2">
                  <span class="sp-video-list__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1C981C"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  Pomažu kod petnog trna
                </h3>
                <p class="sp-video-list__text stext2">
                  Duboka amortizacija pete pomaže kod petnog trna i ublažava snažne udarce ispod osjetljive petne kosti.*
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="sp-video-list__card reveal-on-scroll">
              <div class="sp-video-list__media">
                <video
                  class="sp-video-list__video js-lazy-video"
                  playsinline
                  webkit-playsinline
                  muted
                  loop
                  autoplay
                  preload="none"
                  poster="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/2-poster-2.webp?v=1790751748"
                  width="640"
                  height="400"
                >
                  <source data-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/ed4ec19a44624d3b9f50a4b83d9d3813.webm" type="video/webm">
                </video>
              </div>
              <div class="sp-video-list__body">
                <h3 class="sp-video-list__card-title stexts2">
                  <span class="sp-video-list__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1C981C"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  Obnavljaju potporu stopalu
                </h3>
                <p class="sp-video-list__text stext2">
                  Ojačana potpora svodu stopala pomaže u liječenju plantarnog fascitisa i vraća stabilnu potporu cijelom stopalu.*
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="sp-video-list__card reveal-on-scroll">
              <div class="sp-video-list__media">
                <video
                  class="sp-video-list__video js-lazy-video"
                  playsinline
                  webkit-playsinline
                  muted
                  loop
                  autoplay
                  preload="none"
                  poster="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/2-poster-3.webp?v=1790751747"
                  width="640"
                  height="400"
                >
                  <source data-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/34ffae2fdf784015b381b6a0109b3829.webm" type="video/webm">
                </video>
              </div>
              <div class="sp-video-list__body">
                <h3 class="sp-video-list__card-title stexts2">
                  <span class="sp-video-list__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1C981C"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  Ublažavaju opterećenje Ahilove tetive
                </h3>
                <p class="sp-video-list__text stext2">
                  Potporni ovratnik oko pete ublažava opterećenje Ahilove tetive smanjujući bolan pritisak pri svakodnevnom kretanju.*
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="sp-video-list__card reveal-on-scroll">
              <div class="sp-video-list__media">
                <video
                  class="sp-video-list__video js-lazy-video"
                  playsinline
                  webkit-playsinline
                  muted
                  loop
                  autoplay
                  preload="none"
                  poster="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/2-poster-4.webp?v=1790751747"
                  width="640"
                  height="400"
                >
                  <source data-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/87b698087c404886b74b71ddadd11607.webm" type="video/webm">
                </video>
              </div>
              <div class="sp-video-list__body">
                <h3 class="sp-video-list__card-title stexts2">
                  <span class="sp-video-list__check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="#1C981C"/><path d="M8.833 13.504 5.146 9.851 3 11.936l5.833 5.746L19 7.775l-2.146-2.093-7.021 7.822Z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  Sprječavaju ponovne ozljede
                </h3>
                <p class="sp-video-list__text stext2">
                  Stabilizacija od pete do prstiju sprječava ponovne ozljede ispravljajući nestabilno kretanje i nepravilan položaj stopala pri svakom koraku.*
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>


      {% comment %} 左视频右文案 {% endcomment %}
      <section class="sp-video-right-text" id="hidden-cause">
        <div class="sp-video-right-text__inner">
          <div class="sp-video-right-text__media">
            <video
              class="sp-video-right-text__video"
              playsinline
              webkit-playsinline
              muted
              loop
              autoplay
              preload="auto"
              poster="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/3-poster.webp?v=1790751748"
              width="720"
              height="720"
            >
              <source src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/9eecadff4aa441edaa9cdc420343deaf.webm" type="video/webm">
            </video>
          </div>

          <div class="sp-video-right-text__copy reveal-on-scroll">
            <h2 class="sp-video-right-text__title stitle2">Ponavljajuća bol može skrivati pukotine u kostima</h2>
            <div class="sp-video-right-text__desc stext2">
              <p>
                Prijelomi zamora su <strong>sitne pukotine u kostima koje nose tjelesnu težinu</strong> nastale zbog ponavljanog opterećenja.
              </p>
              <p>
                Bol u početku može biti blaga i popuštati uz odmor, zbog čega <strong>ozljedu lako previdimo.</strong>
              </p>
              <p>
                Daljnje hodanje nastavlja opterećivati oslabljeno područje. Bol postaje lokaliziranija, može se pojaviti oteklina, a <strong>nelagoda se s vremenom može nastaviti i u mirovanju.</strong>
              </p>
              <p>
